## 6.4 Database Operations

### 6.4.1 Data Access Objects (DAOs)

Each table has a corresponding DAO class for CRUD operations:

| Table | DAO Class | Key Methods |
|-------|-----------|-------------|
| `users` | [UserDAO.java](file:///c:/Users/Ahmed/IdeaProjects/Online-Book-Store/src/main/java/com/example/onlinebookstore/Models/UserDAO.java) | createUser, getUserByUsername, updateUser |
| `books` | [BookDAO.java](file:///c:/Users/Ahmed/IdeaProjects/Online-Book-Store/src/main/java/com/example/onlinebookstore/Models/BookDAO.java) | addBook, updateBook, deleteBook, getAllBooks, searchByTitle |
| `categories` | [CategoryDAO.java](file:///c:/Users/Ahmed/IdeaProjects/Online-Book-Store/src/main/java/com/example/onlinebookstore/Models/CategoryDAO.java) | addCategory, updateCategory, deleteCategory, getAllCategories |
| `orders` | [OrderDAO.java](file:///c:/Users/Ahmed/IdeaProjects/Online-Book-Store/src/main/java/com/example/onlinebookstore/Models/OrderDAO.java) | createOrder, getOrdersByCustomer, getAllOrders, updateOrderStatus |
| `order_items` | [OrderItemDAO.java](file:///c:/Users/Ahmed/IdeaProjects/Online-Book-Store/src/main/java/com/example/onlinebookstore/Models/OrderItemDAO.java) | addOrderItem, getOrderItemsByOrder |
| `reviews` | [ReviewDAO.java](file:///c:/Users/Ahmed/IdeaProjects/Online-Book-Store/src/main/java/com/example/onlinebookstore/Models/ReviewDAO.java) | addReview, getReviewsByBook, getAverageRating |

### 6.4.2 Example DAO Operations

**UserDAO - Get User by Username**:
```java
public User getUserByUsername(String username) {
    String sql = "SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = ?";
    try (PreparedStatement pstmt = conn.prepareStatement(sql)) {
        pstmt.setString(1, username);
        ResultSet rs = pstmt.executeQuery();
        
        if (rs.next()) {
            String role = rs.getString("role");
            // Use UserFactory to create appropriate user type
            User user = UserFactory.createUser(role, 
                rs.getString("username"),
                rs.getString("password"),
                rs.getString("address"),
                rs.getString("phone")
            );
            user.setId(rs.getInt("id"));
            return user;
        }
    } catch (SQLException e) {
        e.printStackTrace();
    }
    return null;
}
```

**OrderDAO - Update Order Status**:
```java
public boolean updateOrderStatus(int orderId, String newStatus) {
    // Valid statuses: Pending, Confirmed, Shipped, Delivered, Canceled
    String sql = "UPDATE orders SET status = ? WHERE id = ?";
    
    try (PreparedStatement pstmt = conn.prepareStatement(sql)) {
        pstmt.setString(1, newStatus);
        pstmt.setInt(2, orderId);
        
        int rowsAffected = pstmt.executeUpdate();
        return rowsAffected > 0;
    } catch (SQLException e) {
        e.printStackTrace();
    }
    return false;
}
```

**BookDAO - Get Low Stock Books**:
```java
public List<Book> getLowStockBooks(int threshold) {
    List<Book> books = new ArrayList<>();
    String sql = "SELECT * FROM books WHERE stock < ?";
    
    try (PreparedStatement pstmt = conn.prepareStatement(sql)) {
        pstmt.setInt(1, threshold);
        ResultSet rs = pstmt.executeQuery();
        
        while (rs.next()) {
            books.add(extractBookFromResultSet(rs));
        }
    } catch (SQLException e) {
        e.printStackTrace();
    }
    return books;
}
```

**ReviewDAO - Get Average Rating**:
```java
public double getAverageRating(int bookId) {
    String sql = "SELECT AVG(rating) as avgRating FROM reviews WHERE bookId = ?";
    
    try (PreparedStatement pstmt = conn.prepareStatement(sql)) {
        pstmt.setInt(1, bookId);
        ResultSet rs = pstmt.executeQuery();
        
        if (rs.next()) {
            return rs.getDouble("avgRating");
        }
    } catch (SQLException e) {
        e.printStackTrace();
    }
    return 0.0;
}
```

